{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20966","headline":"春昼 · 李贺","name":"春昼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱城报春更漏转，光风催兰吹小殿。\n草细堪梳，柳长如线。\n卷衣秦帝，扫粉赵燕。\n日含画幕，蜂上罗荐。\n平阳花坞，河阳花县。\n越妇搘机，吴蚕作茧。\n菱汀系带，荷塘倚扇。\n江南有情，塞北无恨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}